.TH CLIENT 1 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test driver program for the libmyutils utility library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is a demonstration program that exercises the functions provided by
.B libmyutils,
a custom C utility library. It tests string manipulation functions
(mystrlen, mystrcpy, mystrncpy, mystrcat) and file utility functions
(wordCount, mygrep) by calling each one and printing the results to
standard output.
.PP
The program expects a file named
.I test.txt
to be present in the current working directory, which it uses to
demonstrate the file-handling functions.
